@host = http://localhost:5171

### Test Dynamic Tenant Connection
GET {{host}}/test-tenant/1
Accept: application/json

### Add Rental Item into Tenant DB
POST {{host}}/tenant/1/rental-items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "itemCode": "DRS001",
  "styleName": "Emerald Velvet Evening Gown",
  "rentalRate": 150.00,
  "replacementValue": 600.00,
  "isActive": true
}

### Read All Rental Items for Tenant 1
GET {{host}}/tenant/1/rental-items
Accept: application/json

### Add Customer to Tenant 1
POST {{host}}/tenant/1/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerCode": "CUST001",
  "customerName": "Juan Dela Cruz",
  "contactNumber": "09171234567",
  "emailAddress": "juan@example.com",
  "address": "Davao City",
  "bustSize": 36.0,
  "waistSize": 28.5,
  "hipSize": 38.0,
  "isActive": true
}

### Read All Customers for Tenant 1
GET {{host}}/tenant/1/customers
Accept: application/json